{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c2c90374-e6b0-864c-902a-38ebe0935a38",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T15:33:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:31:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Teresa Correia. I am calling about a drain in the street, the, um, the catch basin. It is full of sand and the water does not go down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:31:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Where's this at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 458 Bellevue Avenue, in Bellevue. The drain is right in front of the house. It is the sand from the winter, from the road, you know, the salt and the sand. It fills the drain completely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And has there been rain lately?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no rain. It is dry. No storm, nothing. But the water sits in the street three days now. Three days. It comes from the snow that melted, I think, and it has nowhere to go. It is the same every time, and nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three days, that's no good. Is it blocking the road or just pooling at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:32:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is a big puddle across the side of the street, at the curb and more. And my neighbor, she is older, she lives next door, she cannot get out. She cannot walk through the water, and with the ice at night, [pause] como se diz, it is very bad for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I understand. I'll put in a request for a crew to clean out that catch basin at 458 Bellevue. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:32:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0199. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, can I ask, do the crews work on the weekend? Because if nobody comes before, it will be another weekend with the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes they do, depending on the workload, but I can't promise a day. I'll mark it as a standing water issue with an elderly neighbor affected, so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, I appreciate. Honestly, this week is too much. I also signed up to be a chaperone for a dance, and now I regret it. [pause] I should not have said yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, hang in there. Hopefully the drain's one thing we can take off your plate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:33:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I hope so. Thank you, Denise. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T15:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
